    "description": "Once per encounter when an enemy makes an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack of Opportunity\">Attack of Opportunity</a> against you, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a> you can automatically negate the attack and immediately move up to half your speed. This movement does not provoke <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity\" title=\"Attacks of Opportunity\">Attacks of Opportunity</a>.<br><br>If you have the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Combat_Reflexes\" title=\"Combat Reflexes\">Combat Reflexes</a> feat, you may use this Talent a number of times per encounter equal to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> bonus (minimum 1). You may still only use this Talent once per round.",
